roles.prompt:
Audit this website: {{input.website}}
Focus: {{input.focus}}
Target keywords: {{input.target_keywords}}

Analyze:
1. Homepage meta title, description, and headings
2. Site structure (key pages, navigation, URL patterns)
3. Technical elements (robots.txt, sitemap, canonical tags, schema markup)
4. Page speed indicators (image sizes, scripts, render-blocking resources)
5. Mobile friendliness
6. Internal linking structure
7. Content quality signals (word count, keyword usage, freshness)

For competitive focus, also check: {{input.competitors}}

Save detailed crawl data to {{CLUSTER_SHARED_DIR}}crawl/site-data.md
